# Host-only dependency input for the root Meibook runtime.
#
# Use this file only inside the dedicated Python 3.10 Conda environments
# (`meibook` or `meibook-dev`). Do not install it into Conda base. Docker keeps
# its own CUDA-capable dependency resolution until a separately reviewed image
# lock is introduced.
--extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu
-r requirements.txt

